// (docs/spec: str is the value form of UnsizedSlice<u8>), and the annotation lowering adds a SECOND reference for the
// written `&` over `&str` — the `&&i64` twin (`let a: &i64 = ..; let x: &&i64 = &a;`) compiles and runs (exit 0), and the
